   "he": "וְרַבִּי יוֹסֵי אוֹמֵר: שְׁלָחִין אֲסוּרִין. הֵיכִי דָּמֵי שְׁלָחִין? אָמַר רַבִּי יוֹסֵי בַּר חֲנִינָא: כֹּל שֶׁאוֹחֲזוֹ בְּיָדוֹ וְגַרְעִינָתוֹ נִשְׁמֶטֶת.",
   "en": "§ The mishna further teaches: «And Rabbi Yosei says: Overripe» olives «are prohibited.» The Gemara asks: «What are overripe» olives «like? Rabbi Yosei bar Ḥanina says:» This is referring to «any» olive «that» if «one grasps it in his hand, its pit slips out,» due to the softness of the olive."
  }
